# ── Screenshot noise from browser tooling (real image assets re-included) ─────
*.png
!docs/**/*.png
!web/public/**/*.png
!web/src/**/*.png
# Manuscript figures. Every figure in papers/ is TikZ today, so nothing has
# been lost yet -- but a raster figure dropped into a paper's figures/ would
# be silently ignored by the blanket *.png rule above, and `git status` would
# never mention it. papers/ is private in full; this only affects .git-private.
!papers/**/figures/*.png

