# Maintainer's private inbox/backlog (single entry point for ideas + tasks,
# driven by the mska-note skill). Never published.
#
# ⚠ Do NOT add `!.note.md` negations here to let the PRIVATE git track these.
# This file is shared by both gits AND outranks `.git/info/exclude`, so a
# negation here punches straight through the public `/*` default-deny and the
# three files appear as untracked in the PUBLIC git (verified 2026-09-24).
# They are tracked privately via `git --git-dir=.git-private add -f` instead:
# an ignore rule never applies to an already-tracked file.
.note
.note.*
.mohsen.note
.mohsen.note.*

# Generated cache for scripts/testsel.py (rebuilt automatically; ~2.5 s)
.testsel-index.json
